title: macro:ask
tags: [[GUI command]] Macros
kind: reference
summary: In a question while recording: ask it again each time the macro runs

While a macro is being recorded and a command asks a question: the answer about to be given is recorded as a question instead, asked again each time the macro runs ([[Macros]]). Run twice on the same question, it takes the mark back. Anywhere else it fails, saying so.
